    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3513652152616916561, guid: 3fdf55b5e003b3541accf8756e890d39, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'This is Puzzle 3

        The goal of this puzzle is to pick up objects.

        In
        the puzzle, one object is placed far away, one nearby, and one at a medium
        distance.


        For this demo, pick up a block and place it on the matching
        button (based on color).

        Once you''ve done that, the gate on the
        right will open.


        Good luck!


'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
