    - target: {fileID: 8260700449320571420, guid: 3fdf55b5e003b3541accf8756e890d39, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'This is Puzzle 5

        In this puzzle, you''ll learn how to shoot
        using a "gun."


        Pick up the blue "gun" lying on the table to your
        left, and try shooting the blue targets below me.

        Once you''ve hit
        them all, the small gate on the right will open.


        Good luck!'
